# Theme (Sage 11)

Stack: Blade + Acorn + Tailwind v4 + Vite 8. Design CSS is `resources/css/hallowed-ground.css`, not ad-hoc Tailwind utility soup.

## WooCommerce

Theme support and wrapper removal live in `app/setup.php`. Shop / product / cart / checkout render through `resources/views/woocommerce.blade.php`. Booking CTAs use `App\Support\Identity::shopUrl()`.

Companion plugins (optional, sold separately):

- `plugins/hallowed-ground-bookings` — tour slots / party pricing
- `plugins/hallowed-ground-field-map` — `[hg_field_map]` shortcode

## Page templates (slug-based)

| Slug | Template |
| --- | --- |
| (front) | `front-page.blade.php` |
| tours | `page-tours.blade.php` |
| guides | `page-guides.blade.php` |
| area | `page-area.blade.php` |
| contact | `page-contact.blade.php` |
| refund-policy | `page-refund-policy.blade.php` |

Editing `page-{slug}.blade.php` only takes effect if a published Page with that slug exists.

## Query / templates

Do **not** set `is_page` / `is_singular` without a real `WP_Post`. Sage / `post-template.php` will 500. After Blade edits: `wp acorn view:clear --path="$HOME/wp" --allow-root`.

## Identity

Buyer-facing phone, email, brand, hours, concept badge: `App\Support\Identity` + `app/customizer.php`. Defaults stay fiction (`(717) 555-0100`, `tours@hallowedground.test`).

## Admin

Prefer Customizer + normal page/product editing. Do not reintroduce Elementor or the site editor as the required editing path.
